	column Canal = ```
			
			    VAR _Canal = CALCULATE( 
			            MAX( VentasHistoricas[Canal distribución] ) , 
			            FILTER(
			                VentasHistoricas, 
			                VentasHistoricas[Cliente] = Clientes[Cliente] 
			            )
			        )
			      
			    return
			        IF(
			            _Canal = 12, 
			            11, 
			            IF (
			                ISBLANK(_Canal),
			                10,
			                _Canal
			            )
			        )
			```
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: c2adfef9-6f61-40d0-b88d-dc2c55873cfb
		summarizeBy: sum

		annotation SummarizationSetBy = Automatic

